      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-15T19:10:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, judging by their current nemesis pairs, the villains will be the nemeses for Visionary, Unity, Absolute Zero, and Bunker...</p><p>The remaining heroes will be nemeses for Plague Rat (Chrono-Ranger) and Omnitron.</p><p>Unless, of course, they release another promo hero and villain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So you probably shouldn't take that into consideration, but you might.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, are we just designing the character itself, or are we coming up with its general playstyle and gameplay too?</p>",
