      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-15T20:17:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would guess that the most important things to nail down for your villain would be their overall style and feeling, how they fit into the existing SotM lore, and maybe most importantly, what their flip mechanic will be.&nbsp; Remember, it's very important to Christopher that every villain have a unique and fun flip mechanic.</p>",
